# Git LFS -- forward-only setup (added 2026-08-26).
# Existing images already committed to history are NOT migrated (no history
# rewrite, no force-push needed). These patterns only take effect for new
# commits going forward: any new or newly-modified file matching one of these
# extensions gets stored in LFS instead of as a regular git blob.
*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.gif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
